# Desktop boundary

- Renderer must not access Node APIs or Runtime tokens directly.
- New IPC must follow Main → Preload → `index.d.ts` → Renderer.
- All Desktop npm/electron commands run with `cwd=apps/desktop`.
- Generated Runtime HTTP client (`@smc/runtime-client`) is Main-only.
- Keep `node_modules` local to `apps/desktop` (no npm workspaces in v1.0).
- Do not set `COPILOT_PORTAL_ROOT` to the SMC Copilot Monorepo root.
